&lt;p&gt;投票并不能帮到作者。但讨论和批评可以。I&#039;m trying to leave critique with more of my votes, especially when they&#039;re downvotes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我的理论在此：&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a class=&quot;newpage&quot; href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/abolish-the-no-vote-downvote-your-friends-and-other-scp-crit&quot;&gt;Abolish The No Vote, Downvote Your Friends, and Other Musings&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rjb-r&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1229263&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607887386&quot; alt=&quot;RJB_R&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1229263)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rjb-r&quot;  &gt;RJB_R&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;若你也同意，请在评分后留下讨论和批评来帮助作者。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previously, I&#039;d vowed to leave critique with &lt;em&gt;every&lt;/em&gt; downvote I made. Having spent several months doing that, I don&#039;t think it&#039;s always healthy approach. There&#039;s an ideal middle ground. Sometimes your opinions just aren&#039;t helpful, and they&#039;ll only hurt the author without helping them improve. You don&#039;t &lt;em&gt;always&lt;/em&gt; have to explain yourself. Just help out when you can.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;你能在这一页的底部找到一系列我为什么可能不喜欢你的作品的理由。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;如果你读过我的一篇文章，感觉有什么话要说，请留下评论！正面的、负面的或者两者之间的，我很乐意知道我的写作让你感觉到/想到了什么。&lt;/p&gt;
