 一切慧音含谛光，一切善德引妙香<br /> <br /> 每念经文除业种，常怀恩敬拜玄苍<br /> <br /> 从来堕法生劫难，久受三灾环宇伤<br /> <br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/fixedflowers">修正诸邪归朴质</a>，花开福地赞十方<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> </div> <hr /> <p><br /> <br /></p> <div class="earthworm"> <div class="first true"> <div class="inner"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/component%3Aearthworm/Transparent.gif" alt="Transparent.gif" class="image" /> <div class="arrow"></div> </div> <p><a href="/">/</a></p> </div> <div class="hub no"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/fragment:etinjat">芳草萋萋</a></p> </div> <div class="last false"> <div class="inner"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/component%3Aearthworm/Transparent.gif" alt="Transparent.gif" class="image" /> <div class="arrow"></div> </div> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/blooming-on-the-remains">绽放在废墟上的鲜花</a></p> </div> </div> <p><br /></p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4055881&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607887388" alt="Etinjat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4055881)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" >Etinjat</a></span></p> 
