over"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/general-y" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5502162&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607887388" alt="General Y" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5502162)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/general-y" >General Y</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 难道你会记得你吃了多少片Darry吗？我亲爱的<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">JOJO</span> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hens" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6155311&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607887388" alt="Hens" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6155311)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hens" >Hens</a></span>（隐藏留言）<br /> <br /> <br /> 我事吐司吞噬者！面包男子快过来受迫害！（/ /▽/ /）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5474061&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607887388" alt="Auroriaaaaa" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5474061)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa" >Auroriaaaaa</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 回<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5474061&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607887388" alt="Auroriaaaaa" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5474061)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa" >Auroriaaaaa</a></span>：啊啊啊(゜ロ゜) ，太吓人啦！（溜走）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/swred" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5992128&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607887388" alt="Swred" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5992128)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/swred" >Swred</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 跳段街舞 ጿ ኈ ቼ ዽ ጿ ኈ ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rorrerd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3453246&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607887388" alt="rorrErD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3453246)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rorrerd" >rorrErD</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 面包先生可以怎么吃呢（乙烯语气）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raintree" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5375092&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607887388" alt="RainTree" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5375092)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raintree" >RainTree</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 新款星空主题<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-452">面包先生</a>上市了，W博士的新作，十站员工尊享半价，买二赠一等惊喜优惠！订购电话：████████——[该用户已██]<br /> <br /> <br /> RE:[楼上]<br /> 楼上因非法宣传广告而被Darry逮捕，但是其成功 <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">越狱</span> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">生还</span> 逃跑，推测其仍在 <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">传销</span> 宣传推销。——[该用户已██]<br /> <br /> <br /> 楼上虚假宣传！这是赤裸裸的诈骗！——<span style="color: #0645ad">agfarmer</span><br /> <br /> <br /> RE:<span style="color: #0645ad">agfarmer</span><br /> 随便偷人家CSS的小偷也好意思说这种话吗？——全体farmer特工们<br /> <br /> <br /> Darry你好，我是电池，很高兴能让我来十站群。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/guo-mu-ye" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6126600&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607887388" alt="Guo_Mu_Ye" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6126600)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/guo-mu-ye" >Guo_Mu_Ye</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 默默看看Darry的主页～话说这源代码看的我真的脑瓜疼啊——<span style="color: #0645ad">Drsalted fish</span><br /> <br /> <br /> 呐，在写了在写了，呐——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aurora-owl" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6126100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607887388" alt="Dr Aurora Owl" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6126100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aurora-owl" >Dr Aurora Owl</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 租个肝，600一个月，成？——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/higashikatajosuke" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6150792&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607887388" alt="HigashikataJosuke" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6150792)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/higashikatajosuke" >HigashikataJosuke</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 加油，Bro——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5480202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607887388" alt="sciencekiller" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5480202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" >sciencekiller</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 让我往你的脸上涂满巧克力酱，洒满糖豆子，你就是整条街最靓的面包——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vodka-wells" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5721026&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607887388" alt="Vodka Wells" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5721026)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vodka-wells" >Vodka Wells</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 众所周知，Darry经常被紧急调到Site-CN-21，担任站长。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?u